message: "If you use this code, cite it as below, together with the manuscript 'Systemic Levers in Cyber Risk: Which Matter, and When'."
title: "Systemic Levers in Cyber Risk: analysis code, timing revision and mechanism-validation package"
version: "1.2"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-07"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24031842"
authors:
